 "schemaVersion": 1,
 "profile": "p4-texts-v1",
 "notes": "Shared p4-texts-v1 vectors. runtime: a complete valid package every validator accepts. reject: JSON-pointer patches every validator must refuse. cases: semantic runs for the JS preview, packaged mirror and Python model; nodeText lists the resolved text of every text_at node in element order, headline/note the dashboard text_at slots. An index outside 0..len-1 resolves to the empty string. Entries are UTF-8 without control characters (<32, 127), <=120 bytes each, <=64 entries, <=4096 bytes total. text_at needs graphics + p4-variable-bindings-v1 and is exclusive with text/bind/var_bind/field_bind/key_for.",
